Model:

Variables:
For each i ∈ S, j ∈ P:
 x_{ij} ∈ {0, 1, 2, ...}

Objective:
Maximize total value on all shelves:
 maximize ∑_{i∈S} ∑_{j∈P} Value_j * x_{ij}
 =  ∑_{i=1}^{10} ∑_{j=1}^{20} Value_j * x_{ij}

Subject to:

Shelf capacity constraints (for each shelf i):
 ∑_{j∈P} Weight_j * x_{ij} ≤ Capacity_i  ∀ i ∈ S

